          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“All the people of the land must take",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "must take",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " these offerings to the ruling prince of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be his duty to provide the animals to be burnt whole, the grain offerings, and the wine offerings for the whole nation of Israel at the New Moon Festivals, the Sabbaths, and the other festivals. He is to provide the sin offerings, the grain offerings, the offerings to be burnt whole, and the fellowship offerings, to take away the sins of the people of Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
