              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 28.16–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“On the fourteenth day of the first month you will begin the celebration of the Passover Festival. For seven days everyone will eat bread made without yeast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the first day of the festival the ruling prince must offer a bull as a sacrifice for his sins and for those of all the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On each of the seven days of the festival he is to sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " seven bulls and seven rams without any defects and burn them whole. He is also to sacrifice a male goat each day as a sin offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For each bull and each ram that is sacrificed, there is to be an offering of 17.5 litres of corn and three litres of olive oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
